  "effectiveDate": "2020-07-22",
  "historyNote": "#5651, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6968, eff 3-26-99, EXPIRED: 3-26-07 New. #9282, eff 10-1-08; ss by #11147, eff 10-1-16; ss by #13071, eff 7-22-20",
